OL,3,GNEWSAMystery of man found dead in
OL,4,Awetsuit deepens as inquest questions
OL,5,Aethnicity
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn unidentified man whose body was
OL,8,Fdiscovered in a reservoir in Powys two
OL,9,Fyears ago may not have been of white
OL,10,Fethnicity as previously thought, an
OL,11,Finquest has heard.
OL,13,FThe body of the man, who was wearing an
OL,14,Fopen water swimming wetsuit, was found
OL,15,Fby a dogwalker at the Claerwen
OL,16,FReservoir near Rhayader in October
OL,17,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
