OL,3,GNEWSAMystery of man found dead in
OL,4,Awetsuit deepens as inquest questions
OL,5,Aethnicity
OL,6,
OL,7,FDespite a major international police
OL,8,Fappeal and the use of ground-breaking
OL,9,Ffacial reimaging techniques, his
OL,10,Fidentity and the cause of his death
OL,11,Fremain a mystery.
OL,13,FCoroner Patricia Morgan told detectives
OL,14,Fto analyse a liver sample given to the
OL,15,Fpolice two years ago which was never
OL,16,Ftested. She said she wanted to explore
OL,17,F"this further line of inquiry" before
OL,18,Freaching a conclusion.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
